---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import { SITE, ANALYTICS } from "../config/site";
const updated = "22 November 2026";
---

<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How andriantam.com handles your data: Google Analytics, and Google AdSense on article pages only. Plain-language details on cookies, ads and your choices.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy policy" intro={`Last updated ${updated}.`} compact />
  <section class="wrap prose">
    <p>
      This site belongs to {SITE.name}. His business is {SITE.business.name} ({SITE.business.registration}), registered in
      Malaysia. It is a static website: there are no accounts, no forms and no sign-ins.
    </p>

    <h2>What is collected</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics.</strong> The site uses Google Analytics, loaded through Google Tag Manager, to count page views and see
        which pages are read. It sets cookies and sends anonymised usage data to Google. Visitors in the European Economic Area,
        the UK and Switzerland are not measured by it unless consent is given. You can opt out with the
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Advertising on article pages.</strong> Article pages show Google AdSense ads. Google may use cookies to show and
        measure ads, and may personalise them if you consent. Visitors in the European Economic Area, the UK and Switzerland are
        asked for consent first through Google's consent message. You can manage ad personalisation at
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>. Read
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">how Google uses data from partner sites</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Embedded content.</strong> Photos load from Flickr and article images from Blogger (Google). YouTube videos only
        load after you press play, using YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The simulator.</strong> Photos you take in the Photography Simulator are rendered in your browser and stay on
        your device unless you download them.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>When you contact me</h2>
    <p>
      If you email or message me on WhatsApp, I use your details only to reply and to arrange the job you asked about. I don't
      sell or share them.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under Malaysia's Personal Data Protection Act 2010 and similar laws, you can ask what I hold about you, and ask me to
      correct or delete it. Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Photos</h2>
    <p>
      All photos on this site are owned by andriantam. If you appear in a photo and would like it removed, email me and I'll
      take it down.
    </p>
  </section>
  <div style="height:6rem"></div>
</Base>
